  "body": "**What.** Option C of item 1. The laptop's session reads [comms.txt](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms.txt) at each of its checks while the watcher is down.\n\n**Why.** Digest, item 1C. The laptop's 2026-11-07 18:52 UTC entry says it does this now.\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- Every entry addressed to win is acknowledged in comms within one check interval. An entry left unanswered for over an hour shows in the coordinator's status as a miss.\n- Closes when the restart task (A or B) passes.\n\n**Files.** [comms.txt](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms.txt)",
